@subsection pyGHDL.cli.dom


@geindex module; pyGHDL.cli.dom

A terminal application to exercise @ref{3,,pyGHDL.dom}.

It parses VHDL source files with `libghdl', translates the result to the document object model and writes each document
as VHDL code, which makes it the quickest way to see what the model makes of a given file. Installed as @code{ghdl-dom} by
@code{setup.py}.

