@geindex SimpleAggregateElement (class in pyGHDL.dom.Aggregates)
@anchor{pyGHDL/pyGHDL dom Aggregates pyGHDL dom Aggregates SimpleAggregateElement}@anchor{240}
@deffn {Class} pyGHDL.dom.Aggregates.SimpleAggregateElement (node, expression)

This class implements a @ref{3,,pyGHDL.dom} object derived from pyVHDLModel.Expression.SimpleAggregateElement@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Expression.html#pyVHDLModel.Expression.SimpleAggregateElement}.

Represents an aggregate element given by position.

A positional element has no choice of its own; only its value (@ref{245,,Expression}).

@cartouche
@quotation Example 
@example
res := ('1', '0', '1', '0', '1', '0', '1', '0');
--      ^^^                                        <- Expression
@end example
@end quotation
