@code{statement} (ConcurrentStatement@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Concurrent.html#pyVHDLModel.Concurrent.ConcurrentStatement}) – The concurrent statement to insert.
