@code{designUnit} (DesignUnit@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.DesignUnit.html#pyVHDLModel.DesignUnit.DesignUnit}) – The design unit containing this declaration.

