@end itemize


@*Raises: 
@code{UnhandledCriticalWarningError} – If a type mark can’t be resolved, and no
@code{WarningCollector} collects the
UnresolvedTypeMarkWarning@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Exception.html#pyVHDLModel.Exception.UnresolvedTypeMarkWarning}.


@*Return type: 
None@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/constants.html#None}

@end deffn

@geindex ResolveTypeMark() (pyGHDL.dom.Concurrent.ConcurrentBlockStatement method)
@anchor{pyGHDL/pyGHDL dom Concurrent pyGHDL dom Concurrent ConcurrentBlockStatement ResolveTypeMark}@anchor{43a}
@deffn {Method} ResolveTypeMark (place, symbol)

Resolve a type mark at its place in this region and set the symbol’s reference.

@subsubheading Algorithm



@enumerate 

@item 
Clear the symbol’s reference.

@item 
Look up the type mark’s name (@ref{425,,LookupName()}).

@item 
An alias of a type is replaced by the type its name references.

@item 
If the declaration is a type, a subtype or a generic type, it becomes the symbol’s reference. A full type, which
follows the place in the same region, is visible by its incomplete type declaration only to an access type.
@end enumerate

An attribute name denoting a type (e.g. @code{s'subtype}, @code{A'element}) is resolved part by part
(Denote()@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Name.html#pyVHDLModel.Name.Name.Denote}); the type it denotes becomes the symbol’s reference.

@*Parameters: 

@itemize *

@item 
@code{place} (ModelEntity@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Base.html#pyVHDLModel.Base.ModelEntity}) – The declaration containing the type mark.

@item 
@code{symbol} (SubtypeSymbol@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Symbol.html#pyVHDLModel.Symbol.SubtypeSymbol}) – The type mark.
@end itemize


@*Raises: 
@code{UnhandledCriticalWarningError} – If the type mark isn’t visible, is ambiguous, has a prefix, which isn’t a
visible package, denotes no type, or denotes an incomplete type outside of an
access type, and no @code{WarningCollector} collects
the UnresolvedTypeMarkWarning@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Exception.html#pyVHDLModel.Exception.UnresolvedTypeMarkWarning}.


@*Return type: 
None@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/constants.html#None}

@end deffn

