@geindex IndexDeclaredItems() (pyGHDL.dom.Concurrent.ElsifGenerateBranch method)
@anchor{pyGHDL/pyGHDL dom Concurrent pyGHDL dom Concurrent ElsifGenerateBranch IndexDeclaredItems}@anchor{55b}
@deffn {Method} IndexDeclaredItems ()

Index declared items listed in the concurrent declaration region.

@*Return type: 
None@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/constants.html#None}


@subsubheading Algorithm



@enumerate 

@item 
Clear all lookup tables and remove all declared items from @ref{55c,,_namespace}. Interface items and imported
items stay in the namespace.

@item 
Iterate all declared items:


@itemize *

@item 
Every declared item is added to @ref{55c,,_namespace}, except a protected type body.

@item 
If the declared item is a ProtectedTypeBody@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Type.html#pyVHDLModel.Type.ProtectedTypeBody}, skip it: it completes its protected
type.

@item 
If the declared item is a FullType@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Type.html#pyVHDLModel.Type.FullType}, then add an entry to @ref{55d,,_types}.

@item 
If the declared item is a Subtype@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Type.html#pyVHDLModel.Type.Subtype}, then add an entry to @ref{55e,,_subtypes}.

@item 
If the declared item is a Function@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Subprogram.html#pyVHDLModel.Subprogram.Function}, then add an entry to @ref{558,,_functions}.

@item 
If the declared item is a Procedure@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Subprogram.html#pyVHDLModel.Subprogram.Procedure}, then add an entry to @ref{55f,,_procedures}.

@item 
If the declared item is a Constant@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Object.html#pyVHDLModel.Object.Constant}, then add an entry to @ref{54f,,_constants}.

@item 
If the declared item is a Signal@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Object.html#pyVHDLModel.Object.Signal}, then add an entry to @ref{560,,_signals}.

@item 
If the declared item is a Variable@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Object.html#pyVHDLModel.Object.Variable}, TODO.

@item 
If the declared item is a SharedVariable@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Object.html#pyVHDLModel.Object.SharedVariable}, then add an entry to @ref{561,,_sharedVariables}.

@item 
If the declared item is a File@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Object.html#pyVHDLModel.Object.File}, then add an entry to @ref{556,,_files}.

@item 
If the declared item is neither of these types, call @ref{562,,_IndexOtherDeclaredItem()}. 
Derived classes may override this virtual function.
@end itemize
@end enumerate

Indexing again yields the same lookup tables and namespace.


@subsubheading See also



@table @asis

@item pyVHDLModel.Design.IndexPackages()@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.html#pyVHDLModel.Design.IndexPackages}

Iterate all packages in the design and index declared items.

@item pyVHDLModel.Library.IndexPackages()@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.html#pyVHDLModel.Library.IndexPackages}

Iterate all packages in the library and index declared items.

@item pyVHDLModel.DesignUnit.Package._IndexOtherDeclaredItem()@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.DesignUnit.html#pyVHDLModel.DesignUnit.Package._IndexOtherDeclaredItem}

Index the deferred constants and components of a package.
@end table


@*Raises: 
@code{UnhandledCriticalWarningError} – If an identifier is declared twice in a declarative region and no
@code{WarningCollector} collects the
DuplicateDeclarationWarning@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Exception.html#pyVHDLModel.Exception.DuplicateDeclarationWarning}.


@*Return type: 
None

@end deffn

