@deffn {Class} pyGHDL.dom.Concurrent.ElseGenerateBranch (branchNode, declaredItems=None, statements=None, alternativeLabel=None)

This class implements a @ref{3,,pyGHDL.dom} object derived from pyVHDLModel.Concurrent.ElseGenerateBranch@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Concurrent.html#pyVHDLModel.Concurrent.ElseGenerateBranch}.

Represents else-generate branch in a generate statement with a concurrent declaration region and concurrent statements.

@cartouche
@quotation Example 
@example
gen: if condition generate
  -- ...
elsif condition generate
  -- ...
else generate
  -- concurrent declarations
begin
  -- concurrent statements
end generate;
@end example
@end quotation
@end cartouche

