@geindex IfGenerateStatement (class in pyGHDL.dom.Concurrent)
@anchor{pyGHDL/pyGHDL dom Concurrent pyGHDL dom Concurrent IfGenerateStatement}@anchor{309}
@deffn {Class} pyGHDL.dom.Concurrent.IfGenerateStatement (generateNode, label, ifBranch, elsifBranches=None, elseBranch=None)

This class implements a @ref{3,,pyGHDL.dom} object derived from pyVHDLModel.Concurrent.IfGenerateStatement@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Concurrent.html#pyVHDLModel.Concurrent.IfGenerateStatement}.

Represents an if-generate statement.

It has one @code{if} branch (@ref{60a,,IfBranch}), any number of @code{elsif} branches
(@ref{60b,,ElsifBranches}) and an optional @code{else} branch (@ref{60c,,ElseBranch}). The label is
mandatory and the branch conditions must be static expressions.

@cartouche
@quotation Example 
@example
  gen : if WIDTH > 8 generate
--^^^                           <- Label
--      ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^   <- IfBranch
    q <= '0';
  elsif WIDTH > 4 generate
--^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^      <- ElsifBranches[0]
    q <= '1';
  else generate
--^^^^^^^^^^^^^                 <- ElseBranch
    q <= 'Z';
  end generate;
@end example
@end quotation
@end cartouche


