@geindex InsertStatement() (pyGHDL.dom.Concurrent.GenerateCase method)
@anchor{pyGHDL/pyGHDL dom Concurrent pyGHDL dom Concurrent GenerateCase InsertStatement}@anchor{661}
@deffn {Method} InsertStatement (index, statement)

Insert a concurrent statement at a position of this construct.

The statement’s parent is set to this construct: a process, block or generate statement connects its namespace to
this construct’s namespace. If the statements are indexed (@ref{67e,,IndexStatements()}), an instantiation, a block or
a generate statement is added to the lookup table matching its kind, and the statements nested in it are indexed.

