@item 
@code{lookupTable} (dict@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#dict}[str@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str}, Any@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/library/typing.html#typing.Any}]) – The lookup table matching the declared item’s kind.

