@code{item} (NamedEntityMixin@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Base.html#pyVHDLModel.Base.NamedEntityMixin} | MultipleNamedEntityMixin@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Base.html#pyVHDLModel.Base.MultipleNamedEntityMixin}) – The function or procedure, still an interface item or declared item of this region.


@*Raises: 

@itemize *

@item 
@code{NotInNamespaceError} – If the identifier isn’t declared in the namespace.

@item 
@code{NotInNamespaceError} – If the identifier refers to an element, which is no overload, e.g. a duplicate
declaration.
@end itemize


@*Return type: 
None@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/constants.html#None}

@end deffn

