@geindex CaseGenerateStatement (class in pyGHDL.dom.Concurrent)
@anchor{pyGHDL/pyGHDL dom Concurrent pyGHDL dom Concurrent CaseGenerateStatement}@anchor{30e}
@deffn {Class} pyGHDL.dom.Concurrent.CaseGenerateStatement (generateNode, label, expression, cases)

This class implements a @ref{3,,pyGHDL.dom} object derived from pyVHDLModel.Concurrent.CaseGenerateStatement@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Concurrent.html#pyVHDLModel.Concurrent.CaseGenerateStatement}.

Represents a case-generate statement.

The expression being tested is available as @ref{72b,,SelectExpression}, the alternatives as
@ref{72c,,Cases}. The label is mandatory and the selector must be a static expression.

@cartouche
@quotation Example 
@example
  gen : case MODE generate
--^^^                          <- Label
--           ^^^^              <- SelectExpression
    when 0 => q <= '0';
--  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^        <- Cases[0]
    when others => q <= '1';
--  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^   <- Cases[1]
  end generate;
@end example
@end quotation
@end cartouche


