@geindex WaveformElement (class in pyGHDL.dom.Concurrent)
@anchor{pyGHDL/pyGHDL dom Concurrent pyGHDL dom Concurrent WaveformElement}@anchor{310}
@deffn {Class} pyGHDL.dom.Concurrent.WaveformElement (waveNode, expression, after)

This class implements a @ref{3,,pyGHDL.dom} object derived from pyVHDLModel.Base.WaveformElement@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Base.html#pyVHDLModel.Base.WaveformElement}.

Represents one element of a waveform in a signal assignment.

A waveform element assigns a value (@ref{7bc,,Expression}) after an optional delay (@ref{7bd,,After}).

@cartouche
@quotation Example 
@example
s <= '1' after 5 ns;
--   ^^^               <- Expression
--             ^^^^    <- After
@end example
@end quotation
@end cartouche


@subsubheading See also



@itemize *

@item 
Waveform of a simple assignment@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Common.html#pyVHDLModel.Common.WaveformMixin}

@item 
Waveform of one conditional branch@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Common.html#pyVHDLModel.Common.ConditionalWaveform}

@item 
Waveform of one selected alternative@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Common.html#pyVHDLModel.Common.SelectedWaveform}
@end itemize


