@geindex ConditionalWaveform (class in pyGHDL.dom.Concurrent)
@anchor{pyGHDL/pyGHDL dom Concurrent pyGHDL dom Concurrent ConditionalWaveform}@anchor{311}
@deffn {Class} pyGHDL.dom.Concurrent.ConditionalWaveform (node, waveform, condition=None)

This class implements a @ref{3,,pyGHDL.dom} object derived from pyVHDLModel.Common.ConditionalWaveform@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Common.html#pyVHDLModel.Common.ConditionalWaveform}.

Represents one branch of a conditional signal assignment.

Each branch pairs a waveform (@ref{7d3,,Waveform}) with a condition (@ref{7d4,,Condition}). The final
branch has no @code{when}, so its condition is @code{None}.

@cartouche
@quotation Example 
@example
s <= '1' when cond else '0';
--   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^             <- this branch: Waveform=['1'], Condition=cond
--                      ^^^    <- final branch (no `@w{`}when`@w{`}): Waveform=['0'], Condition=None
@end example
@end quotation
@end cartouche


