@geindex SelectedWaveform (class in pyGHDL.dom.Concurrent)
@anchor{pyGHDL/pyGHDL dom Concurrent pyGHDL dom Concurrent SelectedWaveform}@anchor{312}
@deffn {Class} pyGHDL.dom.Concurrent.SelectedWaveform (node, choices, waveform)

This class implements a @ref{3,,pyGHDL.dom} object derived from pyVHDLModel.Common.SelectedWaveform@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Common.html#pyVHDLModel.Common.SelectedWaveform}.

Represents one alternative of a selected signal assignment.

Each alternative pairs a waveform (@ref{7eb,,Waveform}) with the choices selecting it
(@ref{7ec,,Choices}).

@cartouche
@quotation Example 
@example
with sel select s <= '1' when '0', '0' when others;
--                   ^^^^^^^^^^^^                     <- this alternative: Choices=['0'], Waveform=['1']
@end example
@end quotation
@end cartouche


