@geindex InsertContextItem() (pyGHDL.dom.DesignUnit.Entity method)
@anchor{pyGHDL/pyGHDL dom DesignUnit pyGHDL dom DesignUnit Entity InsertContextItem}@anchor{9d9}
@deffn {Method} InsertContextItem (index, contextItem)

Insert a context item at a position of the context clause.

The context item’s parent is set to this design unit. A library clause is also added to @ref{9d2,,LibraryReferences}, a
use clause to @ref{9d3,,PackageReferences} and a context reference to @ref{9d4,,ContextReferences}, in the order of
@ref{9d5,,ContextItems}. A context item may repeat an earlier one.

@*Parameters: 

@itemize *

@item 
@code{index} (int@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/functions.html#int}) – Position, from @code{0} (first) to the number of context items (append). A negative index
counts from the end, as for list.insert()@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#list.insert}: @code{-1} inserts before the last
context item.

@item 
@code{contextItem} (@code{Union}[LibraryClause@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.DesignUnit.html#pyVHDLModel.DesignUnit.LibraryClause}, UseClause@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.DesignUnit.html#pyVHDLModel.DesignUnit.UseClause}, ContextReference@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.DesignUnit.html#pyVHDLModel.DesignUnit.ContextReference}]) – The library clause, use clause or context reference to insert.
@end itemize


@*Raises: 

@itemize *

@item 
ValueError@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/exceptions.html#ValueError} – If parameter ‘index’ is @code{None}.

@item 
TypeError@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/exceptions.html#TypeError} – If parameter ‘index’ is not of type int@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/functions.html#int}.

@item 
ValueError@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/exceptions.html#ValueError} – If parameter ‘index’ is out of range.

@item 
ValueError@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/exceptions.html#ValueError} – If parameter ‘contextItem’ is @code{None}.

@item 
TypeError@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/exceptions.html#TypeError} – If parameter ‘contextItem’ is not of type @ref{986,,LibraryClause}, @ref{987,,UseClause}
or @ref{988,,ContextReference}.

@item 
@code{AlreadyInDesignError} – If parameter ‘contextItem’ already has a parent.
@end itemize


@*Return type: 
None@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/constants.html#None}


@cartouche
@quotation Attention 
The mutator doesn’t update what Analyze()@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.html#pyVHDLModel.Design.Analyze} derived from the context items: the
referenced libraries, packages and contexts (@ref{9d6,,ReferencedLibraries}, @ref{9d7,,ReferencedPackages},
@ref{9d8,,ReferencedContexts}), the namespace entries of a use clause, the edges of the dependency graph, and the
references of the symbols. A design changed after its analysis needs a new analysis.
@end quotation
@end cartouche


