@anchor{pyGHDL/pyGHDL dom DesignUnit pyGHDL dom DesignUnit Entity MoveDeclaredItemAfter}@anchor{a25}
@deffn {Method} MoveDeclaredItemAfter (declaredItem, after)

Move a declared item after another declared item.

The declared item stays a declared item of this declarative region: only the order of the declared items changes,
as for @ref{a11,,MoveDeclaredItem()}. Moving a declared item after itself keeps it in place.

@*Parameters: 

