referenced libraries, packages and contexts (@ref{a80,,ReferencedLibraries}, @ref{a81,,ReferencedPackages},
@ref{a82,,ReferencedContexts}), the namespace entries of a use clause, the edges of the dependency graph, and the
references of the symbols. A design changed after its analysis needs a new analysis.
