@geindex AddGenericItem() (pyGHDL.dom.DesignUnit.Component method)
@anchor{pyGHDL/pyGHDL dom DesignUnit pyGHDL dom DesignUnit Component AddGenericItem}@anchor{b05}
@deffn {Method} AddGenericItem (genericItem, group=None)

Add a generic at the end of the generic clause, or at the end of a generic group.

The generic’s parent is set to this language construct, and its identifiers are added to the language construct’s
namespace, if it has one. Without a generic group, the generic joins the last generic group, or forms a new
unnamed generic group if there are no generics.

@*Parameters: 

@itemize *

@item 
@code{genericItem} (GenericInterfaceItemMixin@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Interface.html#pyVHDLModel.Interface.GenericInterfaceItemMixin}) – The generic to add.

@item 
@code{group} (Optional@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/library/typing.html#typing.Optional}[GenericGroup@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Interface.html#pyVHDLModel.Interface.GenericGroup}]) – Optional, the generic group of this language construct to add the generic to, at
its end. Default: @code{None}, the end of the generic clause.
@end itemize


@*Raises: 

@itemize *

@item 
ValueError@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/exceptions.html#ValueError} – If parameter ‘genericItem’ is @code{None}.

@item 
TypeError@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/exceptions.html#TypeError} – If parameter ‘genericItem’ is not of type
GenericInterfaceItemMixin@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Interface.html#pyVHDLModel.Interface.GenericInterfaceItemMixin}.

@item 
@code{AlreadyInDesignError} – If parameter ‘genericItem’ already has a parent.

@item 
TypeError@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/exceptions.html#TypeError} – If parameter ‘group’ is not of type GenericGroup@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Interface.html#pyVHDLModel.Interface.GenericGroup}.

@item 
@code{NotAChildError} – If parameter ‘group’ is not a generic group of this language construct.

@item 
@code{DuplicateGenericError} – If an existing declaration of the language construct shares an identifier
with the generic.
@end itemize


@*Return type: 
None



