@item 
ValueError@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/exceptions.html#ValueError} – If parameter ‘group’ neither contains nor ends at parameter ‘index’.

@item 
@code{DuplicateGenericError} – If an existing declaration of the language construct shares an identifier
with the generic.
@end itemize


@*Return type: 
None



