@geindex AddContextItem() (pyGHDL.dom.DesignUnit.Package method)
@anchor{pyGHDL/pyGHDL dom DesignUnit pyGHDL dom DesignUnit Package AddContextItem}@anchor{b59}
@deffn {Method} AddContextItem (contextItem)

Add a context item at the end of the context clause.

The context item’s parent is set to this design unit. A library clause is also added to @ref{b5a,,LibraryReferences}, a
use clause to @ref{b5b,,PackageReferences} and a context reference to @ref{b5c,,ContextReferences}, in the order of
@ref{b5d,,ContextItems}. A context item may repeat an earlier one.

@*Parameters: 
@code{contextItem} (@code{Union}[LibraryClause@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.DesignUnit.html#pyVHDLModel.DesignUnit.LibraryClause}, UseClause@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.DesignUnit.html#pyVHDLModel.DesignUnit.UseClause}, ContextReference@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.DesignUnit.html#pyVHDLModel.DesignUnit.ContextReference}]) – The library clause, use clause or context reference to add.


@*Raises: 

@itemize *

@item 
ValueError@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/exceptions.html#ValueError} – If parameter ‘contextItem’ is @code{None}.

@item 
TypeError@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/exceptions.html#TypeError} – If parameter ‘contextItem’ is not of type @ref{986,,LibraryClause}, @ref{987,,UseClause}
or @ref{988,,ContextReference}.

@item 
@code{AlreadyInDesignError} – If parameter ‘contextItem’ already has a parent.
@end itemize


@*Return type: 
None@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/constants.html#None}


@cartouche
@quotation Attention 
The mutator doesn’t update what Analyze()@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.html#pyVHDLModel.Design.Analyze} derived from the context items: the
referenced libraries, packages and contexts (@ref{b5e,,ReferencedLibraries}, @ref{b5f,,ReferencedPackages},
@ref{b60,,ReferencedContexts}), the namespace entries of a use clause, the edges of the dependency graph, and the
references of the symbols. A design changed after its analysis needs a new analysis.
@end quotation
@end cartouche


@subsubheading See also



@table @asis

@item @ref{b61,,InsertContextItem()}

→ Insert a context item at a position of the context clause.

@item @ref{b62,,RemoveContextItem()}

→ Remove a context item from the context clause.
@end table

@end deffn

