@geindex InsertGenericItem() (pyGHDL.dom.DesignUnit.Package method)
@anchor{pyGHDL/pyGHDL dom DesignUnit pyGHDL dom DesignUnit Package InsertGenericItem}@anchor{b67}
@deffn {Method} InsertGenericItem (index, genericItem, group=None)

Insert a generic at a position of the generic clause.

The generic’s parent is set to this language construct, and its identifiers are added to the language construct’s
namespace, if it has one.

Without a generic group, the generic joins the generic group of the generic before @code{index}; at index @code{0}, the
generic group of the first generic. If there are no generics, the generic forms a new unnamed generic group. A
generic group given must contain @code{index} or end at it, so the generic groups stay contiguous.

@*Parameters: 

@itemize *

@item 
@code{index} (int@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/functions.html#int}) – Position, from @code{0} (first) to the length of @ref{b84,,GenericItems} (append).
A negative index counts from the end, as for list.insert()@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#list.insert}: @code{-1} inserts
before the last generic.

@item 
@code{genericItem} (GenericInterfaceItemMixin@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Interface.html#pyVHDLModel.Interface.GenericInterfaceItemMixin}) – The generic to insert.

@item 
@code{group} (Optional@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/library/typing.html#typing.Optional}[GenericGroup@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Interface.html#pyVHDLModel.Interface.GenericGroup}]) – Optional, the generic group of this language construct to insert the generic into.
Default: @code{None}, the generic group of the generic before @code{index}.
@end itemize


@*Raises: 

@itemize *

@item 
ValueError@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/exceptions.html#ValueError} – If parameter ‘index’ is @code{None}.

@item 
TypeError@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/exceptions.html#TypeError} – If parameter ‘index’ is not of type int@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/functions.html#int}.

@item 
ValueError@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/exceptions.html#ValueError} – If parameter ‘index’ is out of range.

@item 
ValueError@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/exceptions.html#ValueError} – If parameter ‘genericItem’ is @code{None}.

@item 
TypeError@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/exceptions.html#TypeError} – If parameter ‘genericItem’ is not of type
GenericInterfaceItemMixin@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Interface.html#pyVHDLModel.Interface.GenericInterfaceItemMixin}.

