@geindex Context (class in pyGHDL.dom.DesignUnit)
@anchor{pyGHDL/pyGHDL dom DesignUnit pyGHDL dom DesignUnit Context}@anchor{984}
@deffn {Class} pyGHDL.dom.DesignUnit.Context (node, identifier, references=None, documentation=None)

This class implements a @ref{3,,pyGHDL.dom} object derived from pyVHDLModel.DesignUnit.Context@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.DesignUnit.html#pyVHDLModel.DesignUnit.Context}.

Represents a context declaration.

A context contains a generic list of all its items (library clauses, use clauses and context references) in
@ref{cf0,,_contextItems}.

Furthermore, when a context gets initialized, the item kinds get separated into individual lists:


@itemize *

@item 
LibraryClause@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.DesignUnit.html#pyVHDLModel.DesignUnit.LibraryClause} → @ref{cf1,,_libraryReferences}

@item 
UseClause@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.DesignUnit.html#pyVHDLModel.DesignUnit.UseClause} → @ref{cf2,,_packageReferences}

@item 
ContextReference@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.DesignUnit.html#pyVHDLModel.DesignUnit.ContextReference} → @ref{cf3,,_contextReferences}
@end itemize

When pyVHDLModel.Design.LinkContexts()@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.html#pyVHDLModel.Design.LinkContexts} got called, these lists were processed and the fields:


@itemize *

@item 
@ref{cf4,,_referencedLibraries} (@code{dict[libName, Library]})

@item 
@ref{cf5,,_referencedPackages} (@code{dict[libName, [pkgName, Package]]})

@item 
@ref{cf6,,_referencedContexts} (@code{dict[libName, [ctxName, Context]]})
@end itemize

are populated. The declarations the use clauses make potentially visible are imported into @ref{cf7,,_namespace}.

@cartouche
@quotation Example 
@example
context ctx is
  -- ...
end context;
@end example
@end quotation
@end cartouche


@subsubheading See also



@itemize *

@item 
Library clause@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.DesignUnit.html#pyVHDLModel.DesignUnit.LibraryClause}

@item 
Use clause@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.DesignUnit.html#pyVHDLModel.DesignUnit.UseClause}
@end itemize


