@anchor{pyGHDL/pyGHDL dom Expression pyGHDL dom Expression InverseExpression DenoteBy}@anchor{da6}
@deffn {Method} DenoteBy (name, region, place, symbol)

Determine the model entity a name denoting this declaration denotes, as a part of a type mark (Name.Denote@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Name.html#pyVHDLModel.Name.Name.Denote}).

A declaration, which a name in a type mark can denote, overrides this method and returns itself: an object, an
alias, a type or subtype, a record element, a package. Any other declaration (e.g. a subprogram) is reported.

@*Parameters: 

@itemize *

@item 
@code{name} (Name@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Name.html#pyVHDLModel.Name.Name}) – The name denoting this declaration, a part of the type mark.

