Each type mark is resolved at its place by the region it is looked up in
(ResolveTypeMark()@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Regions.html#pyVHDLModel.Regions.DeclarativeRegionMixin.ResolveTypeMark}). An incomplete type, an alias and a subtype
extend this method.

