Split()@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Base.html#pyVHDLModel.Base.MultipleNamedEntityMixin.Split} drops it.

@*Returns: 
The single declarations.

