@geindex Denote() (pyGHDL.dom.Name.SelectedName method)
@anchor{pyGHDL/pyGHDL dom Name pyGHDL dom Name SelectedName Denote}@anchor{1889}
@deffn {Method} Denote (region, place, symbol)

Determine the model entity this selected name denotes as a part of a type mark, which is an attribute name.

The type mark is an attribute name like @code{p.c'subtype} or @code{rec.f'subtype}. Depending on the entity the prefix
denotes, this name denotes:


@itemize *

@item 
a library: the package of this name in the library.

@item 
a package: the declaration of this name in the package
(FindDeclarations()@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Namespace.html#pyVHDLModel.Namespace.Namespace.FindDeclarations}); the declaration says what it denotes
(DenoteBy()@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Base.html#pyVHDLModel.Base.ModelEntity.DenoteBy}).

@item 
an object of a record type: the record element of this name
(ElementsByIdentifier@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Type.html#pyVHDLModel.Type.RecordType.ElementsByIdentifier}).
@end itemize

@*Parameters: 

@itemize *

@item 
@code{region} (DeclarativeRegionMixin@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Regions.html#pyVHDLModel.Regions.DeclarativeRegionMixin}) – The declarative region containing the type mark.

@item 
@code{place} (ModelEntity@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Base.html#pyVHDLModel.Base.ModelEntity}) – The declaration containing the type mark.

@item 
@code{symbol} (Symbol@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Symbol.html#pyVHDLModel.Symbol.Symbol}) – The type mark.
@end itemize


@*Return type: 
Optional@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/library/typing.html#typing.Optional}[ModelEntity@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Base.html#pyVHDLModel.Base.ModelEntity}]


@*Returns: 
The denoted model entity, or @code{None} if it can’t be resolved (reported as a
warning).


@*Raises: 

@itemize *

@item 
@code{UnhandledCriticalWarningError} – If the library has no package of this name, and no
@code{WarningCollector} collects the
UnresolvedTypeMarkWarning@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Exception.html#pyVHDLModel.Exception.UnresolvedTypeMarkWarning}.

@item 
@code{UnhandledCriticalWarningError} – If the package declares nothing of this name, and no
@code{WarningCollector} collects the
UnresolvedTypeMarkWarning@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Exception.html#pyVHDLModel.Exception.UnresolvedTypeMarkWarning}.

@item 
@code{UnhandledCriticalWarningError} – If the prefix isn’t an object of a record type with an element of this
name, and no @code{WarningCollector} collects the
UnresolvedTypeMarkWarning@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Exception.html#pyVHDLModel.Exception.UnresolvedTypeMarkWarning}.
@end itemize

@end deffn

