@anchor{pyGHDL/pyGHDL dom NonStandard doc}@anchor{190b}@anchor{pyGHDL/pyGHDL dom NonStandard module-pyGHDL dom NonStandard}@anchor{12}@anchor{pyGHDL/pyGHDL dom NonStandard pyghdl-dom-nonstandard}@anchor{190c}
@subsection pyGHDL.dom.NonStandard


@geindex module; pyGHDL.dom.NonStandard

This module implements the non-standard classes @ref{1d9,,Design}, @ref{a20,,Library} and @ref{9f7,,Document}.

These three are not VHDL language constructs, but the entry points of @ref{3,,pyGHDL.dom}: a document reads
and parses a source file through `libghdl', a library groups documents, and a design owns the libraries.

`Classes'


@itemize -

@item 
@ref{1d9,,Design}:
This class implements a @ref{3,,pyGHDL.dom} object derived from pyVHDLModel.Design@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.html#pyVHDLModel.Design}.

@item 
@ref{a20,,Library}:
This class implements a @ref{3,,pyGHDL.dom} object derived from pyVHDLModel.Library@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.html#pyVHDLModel.Library}.

@item 
@ref{9f7,,Document}:
This class implements a @ref{3,,pyGHDL.dom} object derived from pyVHDLModel.Document@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.html#pyVHDLModel.Document}.
@end itemize


