@geindex AddDocument() (pyGHDL.dom.NonStandard.Design method)
@anchor{pyGHDL/pyGHDL dom NonStandard pyGHDL dom NonStandard Design AddDocument}@anchor{1921}
@deffn {Method} AddDocument (document, library)

Add a document (VHDL source file) to the design and register all embedded design units to the given VHDL library.

All checks are done, before the design, the document or the library is changed.

@subsubheading Algorithm



@enumerate 

@item 
Check the document isn’t a document of a design, and the design contains no document of the same path.

@item 
Check none of the document’s entities, architectures, packages, package bodies, configurations and contexts
exists in the library.

@item 
Add the document to the design and set the document’s library.

@item 
Add the document’s entities, architectures, packages, package bodies, configurations and contexts to the
library and update their library membership.
@end enumerate

@*Parameters: 

@itemize *

@item 
@code{document} (Document@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.html#pyVHDLModel.Document}) – The VHDL source code file.

@item 
@code{library} (Library@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.html#pyVHDLModel.Library}) – The VHDL library used to register the embedded design units to.
@end itemize


@*Raises: 

@itemize *

@item 
ValueError@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/exceptions.html#ValueError} – If parameter ‘document’ is @code{None}.

@item 
TypeError@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/exceptions.html#TypeError} – If parameter ‘document’ is not of type @ref{9f7,,Document}.

@item 
@code{AlreadyInDesignError} – If parameter ‘document’ is already a document of a design.

@item 
@code{DuplicateDocumentError} – If the design already contains a document of the same path.

@item 
ValueError@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/exceptions.html#ValueError} – If parameter ‘library’ is @code{None}.

@item 
TypeError@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/exceptions.html#TypeError} – If parameter ‘library’ is not of type @ref{a20,,Library}.

@item 
@code{LibraryNotRegisteredError} – If the given VHDL library is not a library in the design.

@item 
@code{EntityExistsInLibraryError} – If the processed entity’s name is already existing in the VHDL library.

@item 
@code{ArchitectureExistsInLibraryError} – If the processed architecture’s name is already existing in the VHDL library.

@item 
@code{PackageExistsInLibraryError} – If the processed package’s name is already existing in the VHDL library.

@item 
@code{PackageBodyExistsError} – If the processed package body’s name is already existing in the VHDL library.

@item 
@code{ConfigurationExistsInLibraryError} – If the processed configuration’s name is already existing in the VHDL library.

@item 
@code{ContextExistsInLibraryError} – If the processed context’s name is already existing in the VHDL library.
@end itemize


@*Return type: 
None



@subsubheading See also



@table @asis

@item @ref{1922,,RemoveDocument()}

→ Remove a document from the design.
@end table


@*Return type: 
None@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/constants.html#None}


@*Parameters: 

@itemize *

@item 
@code{document} (Document@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.html#pyVHDLModel.Document})

@item 
@code{library} (Library@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.html#pyVHDLModel.Library})
@end itemize

@end deffn

