@geindex LinkComponents() (pyGHDL.dom.NonStandard.Design method)
@anchor{pyGHDL/pyGHDL dom NonStandard pyGHDL dom NonStandard Design LinkComponents}@anchor{1934}
@deffn {Method} LinkComponents ()

Link components to matching entities found in same VHDL library.

@*Return type: 
None@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/constants.html#None}


@subsubheading Algorithm



@enumerate 

@item 
Iterate all design units with component declarations (packages and architectures):


@enumerate 

@item 
Iterate all component declarations in a package or architecture:


@itemize *

@item 
Check if an entity with matching name can be found in the VHDL library the package is declared within. If
found, set the component’s entity reference to that entity, otherwise check if blackboxes are allowed for
that component. If so, mark the component as a blackbox, otherwise, raise an exception.
@end itemize

@item 
Iterate concurrent statements with declaration regions (block statements, generate statements) if the design
unit is an architecture:


@itemize *

@item 
If the statement is an IfGenerateStatement@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Concurrent.html#pyVHDLModel.Concurrent.IfGenerateStatement}:


@enumerate 

@item 
Iterate declared components in the IfGenerateBranch@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Concurrent.html#pyVHDLModel.Concurrent.IfGenerateBranch}.

@item 
Iterate declared components in each ElsifGenerateBranch@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Concurrent.html#pyVHDLModel.Concurrent.ElsifGenerateBranch}.

@item 
Iterate declared components in the ElseGenerateBranch@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Concurrent.html#pyVHDLModel.Concurrent.ElseGenerateBranch} if it exists.
@end enumerate

@item 
If the statement is an ForGenerateStatement@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Concurrent.html#pyVHDLModel.Concurrent.ForGenerateStatement}:


@enumerate 

@item 
Iterate declared components.
@end enumerate

@item 
If the statement is an CaseGenerateStatement@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Concurrent.html#pyVHDLModel.Concurrent.CaseGenerateStatement}:


@enumerate 

@item 
Iterate declared components.

@item 
Iterate
@end enumerate
@end itemize
@end enumerate
@end enumerate

@*Raises: 
@code{ComponentEntityNotFoundError} – If no entity is found for a component, which doesn’t allow blackboxes.


@*Return type: 
None



