@anchor{pyGHDL/pyGHDL dom NonStandard pyGHDL dom NonStandard Design LinkPackageReferences}@anchor{1932}
@deffn {Method} LinkPackageReferences ()

Link all package references (use clause) to the matching packages, and import the declarations they make
potentially visible.

@*Return type: 
None@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/constants.html#None}


@subsubheading Algorithm



@enumerate 

@item 
Iterate all design units with contexts:


@itemize *

@item 
If the design unit is a primary unit:


@itemize *

@item 
If primary unit isn’t package @code{std.standard}:


@enumerate 

@item 
Iterate all library, packages tuples in @code{DEFAULT_PACKAGES} (@code{std}: [@code{standard}]):


@itemize *

@item 
Raise an exception, if library isn’t listed in design unit’s @code{_referencedLibraries}.

@item 
For every package in packages:


@itemize *

@item 
Get the referenced package by library name and package name from the design.

@item 
Add an entry in the design unit’s @code{_referencedPackages} dictionary referencing the referenced package.

@item 
Add an edge in the dependency graph from design unit to the referenced package.

@item 
Import all declarations of the package into the design unit’s namespace, as by the implicit
@code{use std.standard.all;}.
@end itemize
@end itemize
@end enumerate
@end itemize

@item 
If the design unit is a secondary unit:


@itemize *

@item 
If design unit is an architecture, get the corresponding entity’s referenced packages.

@item 
If design unit is a package body, get the corresponding package’s referenced packages.

@item 
Otherwise, raise an exception
@end itemize

For every referenced package create new dictionary entries in the design unit’s @code{_referencedPackages}.
@end itemize

@item 
Link every use clause of the design unit’s context clause into the design unit’s namespace. 
→ @ref{194c,,_LinkUseClause()}

@item 
Link every use clause in the declarative part of the design unit and of every declarative region nested in it
(e.g. a process, a subprogram or a block) into the namespace of its declarative region. 
→ @ref{194c,,_LinkUseClause()}
@end enumerate


