@geindex InsertDesignUnit() (pyGHDL.dom.NonStandard.Document method)
@anchor{pyGHDL/pyGHDL dom NonStandard pyGHDL dom NonStandard Document InsertDesignUnit}@anchor{199d}
@deffn {Method} InsertDesignUnit (index, designUnit)

Insert a design unit at a position of the document.

The design units of a document are in source order. The design unit’s document is set to this document. If the
document is registered in a design (@ref{1921,,Design.AddDocument()}), the design unit enters the document’s library too:
the library becomes its parent. PSL verification units, properties and modes enter no library.

@*Parameters: 

@itemize *

@item 
@code{index} (int@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/functions.html#int}) – Position, from @code{0} (first) to the number of design units (append).
A negative index counts from the end, as for list.insert()@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#list.insert}.

@item 
@code{designUnit} (DesignUnit@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.DesignUnit.html#pyVHDLModel.DesignUnit.DesignUnit}) – The design unit to insert.
@end itemize


@*Raises: 

@itemize *

@item 
ValueError@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/exceptions.html#ValueError} – If parameter ‘index’ is @code{None}.

@item 
TypeError@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/exceptions.html#TypeError} – If parameter ‘index’ is not of type int@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/functions.html#int}.

@item 
ValueError@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/exceptions.html#ValueError} – If parameter ‘index’ is out of range.

@item 
ValueError@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/exceptions.html#ValueError} – If parameter ‘designUnit’ is @code{None}.

@item 
TypeError@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/exceptions.html#TypeError} – If parameter ‘designUnit’ is not of type
DesignUnit@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.DesignUnit.html#pyVHDLModel.DesignUnit.DesignUnit}.

@item 
@code{AlreadyInDesignError} – If parameter ‘designUnit’ is already a design unit of a document.

@item 
@code{DuplicateDesignUnitError} – If the document contains a design unit of the same kind and identifier.

@item 
@code{EntityExistsInLibraryError} – If the library already contains an entity of the same identifier.

@item 
@code{ArchitectureExistsInLibraryError} – If the library already contains an architecture of the same identifier
for the same entity.

@item 
@code{PackageExistsInLibraryError} – If the library already contains a package of the same identifier.

@item 
@code{PackageBodyExistsError} – If the library already contains a package body of the same identifier.

@item 
@code{ConfigurationExistsInLibraryError} – If the library already contains a configuration of the same identifier.

@item 
@code{ContextExistsInLibraryError} – If the library already contains a context of the same identifier.
@end itemize


@*Return type: 
None



