@geindex RemoveDesignUnit() (pyGHDL.dom.NonStandard.Document method)
@anchor{pyGHDL/pyGHDL dom NonStandard pyGHDL dom NonStandard Document RemoveDesignUnit}@anchor{199e}
@deffn {Method} RemoveDesignUnit (designUnit)

Remove a design unit from the document.

The design unit is detached: its document is cleared. If the document is registered in a design
(@ref{1921,,Design.AddDocument()}), the design unit leaves the document’s library too, and its parent is cleared. The
design unit itself is unchanged and can be added to another document, or inserted at another position.

@*Parameters: 
@code{designUnit} (DesignUnit@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.DesignUnit.html#pyVHDLModel.DesignUnit.DesignUnit}) – The design unit to remove.


@*Raises: 

@itemize *

@item 
ValueError@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/exceptions.html#ValueError} – If parameter ‘designUnit’ is @code{None}.

@item 
TypeError@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/exceptions.html#TypeError} – If parameter ‘designUnit’ is not of type DesignUnit@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.DesignUnit.html#pyVHDLModel.DesignUnit.DesignUnit}.

@item 
@code{NotAChildError} – If parameter ‘designUnit’ is not a design unit of this document.
@end itemize


@*Return type: 
None



@subsubheading See also



@table @asis

@item @ref{199c,,AddDesignUnit()}

→ Add a design unit at the end of the document.

@item @ref{199d,,InsertDesignUnit()}

→ Insert a design unit at a position of the document.
@end table


@*Return type: 
None@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/constants.html#None}


@*Parameters: 
@code{designUnit} (DesignUnit@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.DesignUnit.html#pyVHDLModel.DesignUnit.DesignUnit})

@end deffn

