@deffn {Method} DenoteBy (name, region, place, symbol)

Determine the model entity a name denoting this object denotes, as a part of a type mark: this object.

A port or a parameter isn’t usable in its own interface list (@ref{19ec,,_USABLE_IN_OWN_INTERFACE_LIST}): e.g. the
subtype of a port can’t name another port of the same port list (@code{i'subtype}).

