@geindex IfBranch (class in pyGHDL.dom.Sequential)
@anchor{pyGHDL/pyGHDL dom Sequential pyGHDL dom Sequential IfBranch}@anchor{1bd8}
@deffn {Class} pyGHDL.dom.Sequential.IfBranch (branchNode, condition, statements=None)

This class implements a @ref{3,,pyGHDL.dom} object derived from pyVHDLModel.Sequential.IfBranch@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Sequential.html#pyVHDLModel.Sequential.IfBranch}.

Represents the @code{if} branch of an if statement.

The branch’s condition is available as @ref{1bf7,,Condition}, its body as @ref{1bf8,,Statements}.

@cartouche
@quotation Example 
The whole if statement is shown; the bracket marks the part this class represents.

@example
if sel = '0' then     -- ┐ IfBranch
-- ^^^^^^^^^          -- │   <- Condition
  s <= '0';           -- │
--^^^^^^^^^           -- ┘   <- Statements
elsif sel = '1' then
  s <= '1';
else
  s <= '0';
end if;
@end example
@end quotation
@end cartouche

