@geindex CaseStatement (class in pyGHDL.dom.Sequential)
@anchor{pyGHDL/pyGHDL dom Sequential pyGHDL dom Sequential CaseStatement}@anchor{1be0}
@deffn {Class} pyGHDL.dom.Sequential.CaseStatement (caseNode, label, expression, cases)

This class implements a @ref{3,,pyGHDL.dom} object derived from pyVHDLModel.Sequential.CaseStatement@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Sequential.html#pyVHDLModel.Sequential.CaseStatement}.

Represents a case statement.

The expression being tested is available as @ref{1d00,,SelectExpression}, the alternatives as
@ref{1d01,,Cases}.

@cartouche
@quotation Example 
@example
  lbl : case sel is
--^^^                          <- optional Label
--           ^^^               <- SelectExpression
    when '0'    => s <= '1';
--  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^   <- Cases[0]
    when others => null;
--  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^       <- Cases[1]
  end case;
@end example
@end quotation
@end cartouche


