@geindex EndlessLoopStatement (class in pyGHDL.dom.Sequential)
@anchor{pyGHDL/pyGHDL dom Sequential pyGHDL dom Sequential EndlessLoopStatement}@anchor{1be1}
@deffn {Class} pyGHDL.dom.Sequential.EndlessLoopStatement (loopNode, statements=None, label=None)

This class implements a @ref{3,,pyGHDL.dom} object derived from pyVHDLModel.Sequential.EndlessLoopStatement@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Sequential.html#pyVHDLModel.Sequential.EndlessLoopStatement}.

Represents an endless loop statement.

The loop body is available as @ref{1d1f,,Statements}. The loop has no iteration scheme, so it is
left with an exit or return statement.

@cartouche
@quotation Example 
