@geindex WhileLoopStatement (class in pyGHDL.dom.Sequential)
@anchor{pyGHDL/pyGHDL dom Sequential pyGHDL dom Sequential WhileLoopStatement}@anchor{1be3}
@deffn {Class} pyGHDL.dom.Sequential.WhileLoopStatement (loopNode, condition, statements=None, label=None)

This class implements a @ref{3,,pyGHDL.dom} object derived from pyVHDLModel.Sequential.WhileLoopStatement@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Sequential.html#pyVHDLModel.Sequential.WhileLoopStatement}.

Represents a while-loop statement.

The loop condition is available as @ref{1d77,,Condition}, the loop body as @ref{1d78,,Statements}.

@cartouche
@quotation Example 
@example
  lbl : while i < 4 loop
--^^^                      <- optional Label
--            ^^^^^        <- Condition
    null;
--  ^^^^^                  <- Statements
  end loop;
@end example
@end quotation
@end cartouche


