@geindex ConditionalExpression (class in pyGHDL.dom.Sequential)
@anchor{pyGHDL/pyGHDL dom Sequential pyGHDL dom Sequential ConditionalExpression}@anchor{1be5}
@deffn {Class} pyGHDL.dom.Sequential.ConditionalExpression (node, expression, condition=None)

This class implements a @ref{3,,pyGHDL.dom} object derived from pyVHDLModel.Common.ConditionalExpression@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Common.html#pyVHDLModel.Common.ConditionalExpression}.

Represents one branch of a conditional variable assignment.

Each branch pairs an expression (@ref{1dc1,,Expression}) with a condition (@ref{1dc2,,Condition}). The
final branch has no @code{when}, so its condition is @code{None}.

@cartouche
@quotation Example 
@example
v := '1' when cond else '0';
--   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^             <- this branch: Expression='1', Condition=cond
--                      ^^^    <- final branch (no `@w{`}when`@w{`}): Expression='0', Condition=None
@end example
@end quotation
@end cartouche


