@geindex SequentialConditionalVariableAssignment (class in pyGHDL.dom.Sequential)
@anchor{pyGHDL/pyGHDL dom Sequential pyGHDL dom Sequential SequentialConditionalVariableAssignment}@anchor{1be9}
@deffn {Class} pyGHDL.dom.Sequential.SequentialConditionalVariableAssignment (assignmentNode, target, conditionalExpressions, label=None)

This class implements a @ref{3,,pyGHDL.dom} object derived from pyVHDLModel.Sequential.SequentialConditionalVariableAssignment@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Sequential.html#pyVHDLModel.Sequential.SequentialConditionalVariableAssignment}.

Represents a conditional sequential variable assignment.

The alternatives are available as @ref{1e20,,ConditionalExpressions}, a list of
ConditionalExpression@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Common.html#pyVHDLModel.Common.ConditionalExpression}. The model holds them in a list and has no
distinct field per alternative, so the markers below name list elements.

@cartouche
@quotation Example 
@example
  lbl : v := '1' when sel = '0' else '0';
--^^^                                       <- optional Label
--      ^                                   <- Target
--           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^             <- ConditionalExpressions[0]
--                                   ^^^    <- ConditionalExpressions[1]
@end example
@end quotation
@end cartouche


