@geindex InsertParameterAssociationItem() (pyGHDL.dom.Sequential.SequentialProcedureCall method)
@anchor{pyGHDL/pyGHDL dom Sequential pyGHDL dom Sequential SequentialProcedureCall InsertParameterAssociationItem}@anchor{1ed9}
@deffn {Method} InsertParameterAssociationItem (index, parameterAssociationItem)

Insert a parameter association at a position of the parameter association list.

The association’s parent is set to this procedure call.

A named association (@code{formal => actual}) can’t repeat the formal of another named association of the parameter
association list. Only formals given as a simple name are compared: a partial association (@code{a(0) => x}) or a
conversion function (@code{to_integer(a) => x}) is accepted. All positional associations precede the named
associations.

@*Parameters: 

@itemize *

@item 
@code{index} (int@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/functions.html#int}) – Position, from @code{0} (first) to the number of parameter associations
(append). A negative index counts from the end, as for
list.insert()@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#list.insert}: @code{-1} inserts before the last parameter
association.

@item 
@code{parameterAssociationItem} (ParameterAssociationItem@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Association.html#pyVHDLModel.Association.ParameterAssociationItem}) – The parameter association to insert.
@end itemize


@*Raises: 

@itemize *

@item 
ValueError@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/exceptions.html#ValueError} – If parameter ‘index’ is @code{None}.

@item 
TypeError@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/exceptions.html#TypeError} – If parameter ‘index’ is not of type int@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/functions.html#int}.

@item 
ValueError@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/exceptions.html#ValueError} – If parameter ‘index’ is out of range.

@item 
ValueError@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/exceptions.html#ValueError} – If parameter ‘parameterAssociationItem’ is @code{None}.

@item 
TypeError@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/exceptions.html#TypeError} – If parameter ‘parameterAssociationItem’ is not of type
ParameterAssociationItem@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Association.html#pyVHDLModel.Association.ParameterAssociationItem}.

@item 
@code{AlreadyInDesignError} – If parameter ‘parameterAssociationItem’ already has a parent.

@item 
@code{DuplicateParameterAssociationError} – If the association is named, and another named association of the
parameter association list has the same formal.

@item 
@code{AssociationOrderError} – If the association is positional, and a named association precedes the
position.

@item 
@code{AssociationOrderError} – If the association is named, and a positional association follows the
position.
@end itemize


