@geindex NullStatement (class in pyGHDL.dom.Sequential)
@anchor{pyGHDL/pyGHDL dom Sequential pyGHDL dom Sequential NullStatement}@anchor{1bf3}
@deffn {Class} pyGHDL.dom.Sequential.NullStatement (waitNode, label=None)

This class implements a @ref{3,,pyGHDL.dom} object derived from pyVHDLModel.Sequential.NullStatement@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Sequential.html#pyVHDLModel.Sequential.NullStatement}.

Represents a null statement.

A null statement does nothing. Like every sequential statement, it can carry an optional label
(@ref{1f4e,,Label}).

