@geindex NextStatement (class in pyGHDL.dom.Sequential)
@anchor{pyGHDL/pyGHDL dom Sequential pyGHDL dom Sequential NextStatement}@anchor{1bf4}
@deffn {Class} pyGHDL.dom.Sequential.NextStatement (node, condition=None, loopLabel=None, label=None)

This class implements a @ref{3,,pyGHDL.dom} object derived from pyVHDLModel.Sequential.NextStatement@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Sequential.html#pyVHDLModel.Sequential.NextStatement}.

Represents a next statement.

A next statement skips to the next iteration of the named loop (@ref{1f66,,LoopReference}),
optionally only when a condition (@ref{1f67,,Condition}) holds.

@cartouche
@quotation Example 
@example
  lbl : next outer when k = 1;
--^^^                            <- optional Label
--           ^^^^^               <- optional LoopReference
--                      ^^^^^    <- optional Condition
@end example
@end quotation
@end cartouche

