@geindex Procedure (class in pyGHDL.dom.Subprogram)
@anchor{pyGHDL/pyGHDL dom Subprogram pyGHDL dom Subprogram Procedure}@anchor{436}
@deffn {Class} pyGHDL.dom.Subprogram.Procedure (node, procedureName, genericItems=None, parameterItems=None, declaredItems=None, statements=None, documentation=None)

This class implements a @ref{3,,pyGHDL.dom} object derived from pyVHDLModel.Subprogram.Procedure@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Subprogram.html#pyVHDLModel.Subprogram.Procedure}.

Represents a procedure.

Unlike a function, a procedure returns no value. Besides its parameters, it has its own
declarative part (@ref{20de,,DeclaredItems}) and statements (@ref{20df,,Statements}).

@cartouche
@quotation Example 
@example
procedure proc(signal s : in bit; variable v : out bit) is
--        ^^^^                                               <- Identifier
--             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^       <- ParameterItems
  variable tmp : bit;
--^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^                                        <- DeclaredItems
begin
  tmp := s;
--^^^^^^^^^                                                  <- Statements
  v := tmp;
end procedure;
@end example
@end quotation
@end cartouche


