A negative index counts from the end, as for list.insert()@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#list.insert}: @code{-1} inserts
before the last parameter.

@item 
@code{parameterItem} (ParameterInterfaceItemMixin@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Interface.html#pyVHDLModel.Interface.ParameterInterfaceItemMixin}) – The parameter to insert.

