@geindex InsertGenericItem() (pyGHDL.dom.Subprogram.ProcedureMethod method)
@anchor{pyGHDL/pyGHDL dom Subprogram pyGHDL dom Subprogram ProcedureMethod InsertGenericItem}@anchor{216c}
@deffn {Method} InsertGenericItem (index, genericItem, group=None)

Insert a generic at a position of the generic clause.

The generic’s parent is set to this language construct, and its identifiers are added to the language construct’s
namespace, if it has one.

Without a generic group, the generic joins the generic group of the generic before @code{index}; at index @code{0}, the
generic group of the first generic. If there are no generics, the generic forms a new unnamed generic group. A
generic group given must contain @code{index} or end at it, so the generic groups stay contiguous.

@*Parameters: 

@itemize *

@item 
