@code{genericAssociationItem} (GenericAssociationItem@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Association.html#pyVHDLModel.Association.GenericAssociationItem}) – The generic association to insert.
