@geindex SplitParameterItem() (pyGHDL.dom.Subprogram.ProcedureInstantiation method)
@anchor{pyGHDL/pyGHDL dom Subprogram pyGHDL dom Subprogram ProcedureInstantiation SplitParameterItem}@anchor{22d2}
@deffn {Method} SplitParameterItem (parameterItem)

Split a parameter with an identifier list into one parameter per identifier.

The parameter keeps its first identifier. For every other identifier, a new parameter is created by its
@code{Copy()} and inserted right after it, in list order, in the parameter list and in the parameter’s parameter
group; its parent is set to this language construct. If the language construct has a namespace, the entries of the
other identifiers refer to the new parameters. A parameter declaring one identifier is unchanged.

@*Parameters: 
@code{parameterItem} (ParameterInterfaceItemMixin@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Interface.html#pyVHDLModel.Interface.ParameterInterfaceItemMixin}) – The parameter to split.


