tuple@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#tuple}[ParameterInterfaceItemMixin@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Interface.html#pyVHDLModel.Interface.ParameterInterfaceItemMixin}, ...@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/constants.html#Ellipsis}]


@*Returns: 
Tuple of parameters, one per identifier in list order, starting with the split
parameter.


@*Raises: 

@itemize *

@item 
ValueError@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/exceptions.html#ValueError} – If parameter ‘parameterItem’ is @code{None}.

@item 
TypeError@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/exceptions.html#TypeError} – If parameter ‘parameterItem’ is not of type
ParameterInterfaceItemMixin@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Interface.html#pyVHDLModel.Interface.ParameterInterfaceItemMixin}.

@item 
@code{NotAChildError} – If parameter ‘parameterItem’ is not a parameter of this language construct.

@item 
@code{NotInNamespaceError} – If the namespace is indexed, and an identifier of the parameter refers to another
element, e.g. a duplicate declaration.
@end itemize



