Represents a reference to a record subtype with constrained elements.

The referenced language entity is available as @ref{25a3,,Reference} once resolved. Each constrained record element has
an element constraint: an ArrayElementConstraint@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Symbol.html#pyVHDLModel.Symbol.ArrayElementConstraint} or a nested
RecordElementConstraint@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Symbol.html#pyVHDLModel.Symbol.RecordElementConstraint}.

