@geindex IncompleteType (class in pyGHDL.dom.Type)
@anchor{pyGHDL/pyGHDL dom Type pyGHDL dom Type IncompleteType}@anchor{2667}
@deffn {Class} pyGHDL.dom.Type.IncompleteType (node, identifier, documentation=None)

This class implements a @ref{3,,pyGHDL.dom} object derived from pyVHDLModel.Type.AnonymousType@footnote{https://vhdl.github.io/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel/pyVHDLModel.Type.html#pyVHDLModel.Type.AnonymousType}.

Represents a base-class for types without a type definition of their own.

An incomplete type is the typical case: it names a type (@ref{2674,,Identifier}) whose full
definition follows later in the same declarative part.

@cartouche
@quotation Example 
@example
type node;
--   ^^^^                  <- Identifier
type ptr is access node;
type node is record
  value    : integer;
  nextNode : ptr;
end record;
@end example
@end quotation
@end cartouche

