@code{NotInNamespaceError} – If the identifier isn’t declared in the namespace.

@item 
@code{NotInNamespaceError} – If the identifier refers to an element, which is no overload, e.g. a duplicate
declaration.
@end itemize


@*Return type: 
None@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/constants.html#None}

@end deffn

