@subsection pyGHDL.libghdl._decorator


@geindex module; pyGHDL.libghdl._decorator

Decorators binding a Python function to a subprogram in the shared library @code{libghdl}.

@code{BindToLibGHDL()} reads a function’s type hints, derives the matching ctypes@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/library/ctypes.html#module-ctypes} signature and replaces the
function body with a call into the shared library. @ref{28f1,,EnumLookupTable()} precalculates an enum position to name
table.

