@subsection pyGHDL.libghdl.errorout_memory


@geindex module; pyGHDL.libghdl.errorout_memory

Python binding for the Ada package @code{Errorout.Memory} in `libghdl'.

Collects analysis messages in memory instead of printing them, so a caller can read them back with
@ref{29d3,,Get_Nbr_Messages()} and @ref{29d4,,Get_Error_Record()}. @ref{1d9,,Design} installs this handler.

