@subsection pyGHDL.libghdl.files_map_editor


@geindex module; pyGHDL.libghdl.files_map_editor

Python binding for the Ada package @code{Files_Map.Editor} in `libghdl'.

Modifies the content of a source buffer in place, which is what the language server uses to apply an edit without
reloading the file.

`Functions'


@itemize -

@item 
