@code{Keep_Obsolete} (bool@footnote{https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/functions.html#bool}) – 
If @code{Keep_Obsolete} is @code{True}, obsoleted units are
kept in the library.

This is used when a whole design file has to be added
in the library and then processed (without that feature,
redefined units would disappear).

@end itemize


