@subsubsection pyGHDL.libghdl.vhdl.nodes


@geindex module; pyGHDL.libghdl.vhdl.nodes

Python binding for the Ada package @code{Vhdl.Nodes} in `libghdl'.

The IIR tree: the node kinds, the enumerations their fields use, and the accessor pair for every field.
See @ref{2adc,,AST} for what a node is and how the fields are addressed.

