@subsubsection pyGHDL.libghdl.vhdl.nodes_meta


@geindex module; pyGHDL.libghdl.vhdl.nodes_meta

Python binding for the Ada package @code{Vhdl.Nodes_Meta} in `libghdl'.

The meta-model: which fields a node kind has, of what type, and with what access attribute. It is what lets an
algorithm walk any node without knowing its kind.

