@section pyGHDL.lsp


@geindex module; pyGHDL.lsp

Implementation of GHDL’s language server.

The package is layered, from the wire upwards:


@enumerate 

@item 
@ref{3f,,pyGHDL.lsp.lsp} speaks the Language Server Protocol over stdin and stdout.

@item 
@ref{43,,pyGHDL.lsp.vhdl_ls} implements the VHDL-specific requests on top of it.

@item 
@ref{44,,pyGHDL.lsp.workspace} and @ref{3e,,pyGHDL.lsp.document} hold the analyzed sources the requests are answered
from.
@end enumerate

The entry point is @ref{2,,pyGHDL.cli.lsp}.

