@subsection pyGHDL.lsp.lsp


@geindex module; pyGHDL.lsp.lsp

The transport and dispatch layer of the Language Server Protocol.

@code{LSPConn} reads and writes the @code{Content-Length} framed JSON-RPC messages on a pair of streams, and
@code{LanguageProtocolServer} runs the request loop: it decodes a message, calls the matching handler on the server
object and writes the response. It knows nothing about VHDL - @ref{43,,pyGHDL.lsp.vhdl_ls} supplies the handlers.

