@subsection pyGHDL.lsp.lsptools


@geindex module; pyGHDL.lsp.lsptools

A small command line helper to convert a captured protocol trace between its LSP and JSON forms.

A trace recorded by @code{LSPConnTrace} is a stream of @code{Content-Length} framed messages; @code{lsp2json}
turns it into plain JSON and @code{json2lsp} back again, which is what makes a recorded session replayable.

