@anchor{internals/ast/43-other-242 iir-kind-simultaneous-elsif}@anchor{38e7}@anchor{internals/ast/43-other-242 int-ast-simultaneous-elsif}@anchor{38e8}
@subsubsection Iir_Kind_Simultaneous_Elsif


AMS-LRM17 11.11 Simultaneous if statement

@example
simultaneous_if_statement ::=
  [ /if/_label : ]
    IF condition USE
      simultaneous_statement_part
    @{ ELSIF condition USE
      simultaneous_statement_part @}
    [ ELSE
      simultaneous_statement_part ]
    END USE [ /if/_label ];
@end example

